There's a bit of a performance issue when running with OpenCode due to a lot of redundant processing caused by handling the partial outputs and it noticeably slows down with TalkiTo running. Feel free to flip the supported boolean to True but perhaps don't use the local whisper asr and tts models when using OpenCode.
